Much has happened. While Leusen was being defeated and Arteres attacked the surface with Octulhus, Yagditha tried to take the trident from Yaten and was wounded by her. Midranda killed her and bewitched Yagditha, seizing the throne.
With Zarad's Magic Shell, my song awakened Arteres.
And after breaking free of Midranda's control, Yagditha offered an alliance to Prince Zarad. But he took Hermit and me hostage to force Zarad to give himself up.

He sacrificed himself for me. Help me find my Zarad.

[Challenge Objective]

Find the Rough Scale by hunting Dey or Koon in the Abyss of the Sea.
When you are done, talk to Marina in the Abyss of the Sea.
